{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rot Forever is an FPS horror game set in a decaying megastructure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight or Flee</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight monsters using guns and your fists. Run and hide from the ones that are too strong to fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Platform</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump over chasms, run across narrow beams and avoid traps as you traverse the megastructure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles to progress, open short cuts and unlock secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade &amp; Equip</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a variety of weapons and tools. Find and ingest larva to gain new permanent abilities.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3458390?t=1773316202","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458390/3fd9bab82a55705f01cba6b1878c314eccd7ead6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773316202","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458390/7ac179a6710b934c4aab10ee540e66c5ba575661/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773316202","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3458390/7ac179a6710b934c4aab10ee540e66c5ba575661/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773316202","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"This game contains violence and nudity."},"demos":[{"appid":4062000,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rot Forever is an FPS horror game set in a decaying